  "schema:comment": [
    "The working-electrode disc built into coin cell 979353, punched from electrode batch NMC532-NMP-1. LiNi0.5Mn0.3Co0.2O2 (commercial electrode).",
    "Every figure here is the value metadata.csv publishes for this one cell, not a batch average; the batch averages are on the electrode spec.",
    "Active-material mass 31.4024 mg = coating mass (32.501 mg) x active-material weight percentage (96.62 %), the way metadata.csv derives it. Both factors are structured properties of this record; the product is not, because `mass` is the one curated key that means Mass and a second one would collapse onto it in JSON-LD."
  ],
